{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你們也真是閒欸……」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4453", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔才不是閒。就算是聖誕節也有很多事……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3441", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯，除了學校的工作以外還有其他事啊。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4454", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3442", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早知如此，不要逞強不就好了……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4455", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔、安、安潔才沒有寂寞呢！」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3443", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是這種人設嗎？", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "算了，先不想那個。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我沒想到聖誕節當天，會在社團教室裡見到大家。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，為什麼新吾也在？」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1595", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼為什麼？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你跟天羽學姊已經破局了？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4456", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然瀨名同學也知道了嗎？", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，沒有喔。我只是想跟家人一起過聖誕節……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎，櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4457", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今年跟愛理過聖誕節。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sk1326", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對啊，之前就約好了。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4458", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是說……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1596", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然是破局了啊。被美羽學姊說『派不上用場』了吧。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3444", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為什麼她說得那麼開心的樣子……", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟對象是天羽學姊……能配得上那個人的男人，本來就很少見了。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4459", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家已經肯定我被甩了嗎？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學的背影，散發出一股哀愁的氣息……」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3445", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我懶得否定了。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然你戴的帽子挺有品味的，但是男人又不能只靠這個……」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4460", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒看過這頂帽子。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sk1327", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是昨天……應該說今天，美羽學姊送我的。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃當然不知道。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該不可能……是美羽學姊的親手編織的吧。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3446", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1597", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來只有紗凪認出這頂毛帽是學姊親手編的。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這頂帽子真的很溫暖。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是第一次收到親手做的禮物，所以想一直戴著。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但頭頂有點悶熱了。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……大家也來了啊，聖誕快樂♪」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2042", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊走進社團教室，大家也向她打招呼祝聖誕快樂。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君也是～」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2043", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聖誕快樂。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看了一眼我戴著的毛帽，學姊立刻害羞地低下頭。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕、嚕。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0394", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，小熊喵？想讓新吾君抱抱嗎？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2044", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嗚嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0395", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼。新吾君，可以請你抱一下牠嗎？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2045", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭解，來吧熊喵。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕♪」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0396", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵活力充沛地跳到我的胸口。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，抱著熊喵就好溫暖……」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0397", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且有美羽學姊的氣味。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住把臉埋在熊喵的毛中。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……兩、兩位不是破局了嗎？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3447", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如妳所見吧。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4461", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然壓低了音量，但我還是聽得一清二楚。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剛好是個機會，我就正式跟大家報告與美羽學姊的關係吧。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2046", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且美羽學姊聽到安潔她們小聲的談話，也一臉困擾的表情。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……大家，可以聽我說一下嗎？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到大家視線都集中在我身上，我接著說。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種事情，其實我覺得沒有必要特地報告。」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我，跟美羽學姊交往了。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新、新吾君……」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2047", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是我也不喜歡躲躲藏藏的，所以還是決定跟大家說……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到學姊滿臉通紅，我的臉也熱了起來。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……管他的，雖然是在大家面前，但還是牽手吧。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2048", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊回握了我的手，大家沒有特別的反應。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "太緊繃了吧，這種氣氛……", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就、就是這樣，報告結束。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我對大家點頭致意，然後觀察她們的表情。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果只有紗凪一個人忍笑忍得身體都在發抖。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……紗凪，沒有人這樣的吧。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗、啊哈哈哈！因為啊～看你緊張得全身僵硬，太好笑了。」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……安潔也到忍耐的極限了！已經想祝福兩位想得受不了了！」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3448", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然有點好奇你們兩人是怎麼交往的……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4462", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好嫩。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sk1328", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被櫻乃這麼一指，我整個人都羞恥得快要燒起來了。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恭喜你們，新吾同學、美羽學姊！祝福兩位早日生下健康的小寶寶！」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3449", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，那個還太早了吧……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「問題不在那裡。我絕對不會把美羽學姊的純潔交給像你這樣的傢伙！」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……那個，我已經得到了喔。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2049", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我的純潔也獻給學姊了。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……昨天還第一次用嘴巴幫我做了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，要加油生下健康的小寶寶。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sk1329", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，要生的不是妳哥哥是天羽學姊喔。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4463", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你懂的吧？不准去想跟美羽學姊交配喔！」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn1600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交、交配……」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗同學，女孩子不可以把交配這種話掛在嘴上喔！」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "ag3450", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交配。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sk1330", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃也不要說啦，交配這種詞，很下流。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "ar4464", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知不覺中，整個社團教室充斥著下流的詞彙。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2050", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不過，也好啦。能看到學姊的這個笑容。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這樣一來就不必在意周圍的視線了。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隨時隨地都可以跟美羽學姊卿卿我我……！", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不要動喔，現在幫妳裝上去。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2051", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦……妳比之前長得更大了？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2052", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，真是的這麼有精神～」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2053", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，卿卿我我的。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊正在幫熊喵裝上她新作的翅膀飾品。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她們甜甜蜜蜜的模樣，我什麼話都說不出口了。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，怎麼樣？會不會痛？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2054", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0398", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了……之前一直沒見到妳，我好寂寞喔。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2055", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕、嚕。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0399", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今後天氣要變更冷了，妳可不能感冒囉！」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2056", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕♪」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0400", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……小熊喵，肚子餓了嗎？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2057", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我買了好多小熊喵喜歡的雞胸肉起司味的罐頭喔。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2058", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0401", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那妳等一下喔，我現在準備……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2059", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也來幫忙吧？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，沒關係，新吾君休息吧。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2060", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊從架子上拿出罐頭，熟練地打開並倒在容器裡。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一開始我站在旁邊看著，但漸漸按捺不住，於是從背後抱住了她。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君也肚子餓了嗎～？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2061", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，妨礙妳了。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「完全沒有妨礙我喔～餵完小熊喵吃飯後，我也想要抱抱呢！」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2062", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就來抱抱妳吧。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，等一下，小熊喵先……啊！」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2063", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我用力抱緊她，親吻她的脖子，學姊立刻敏感地起了反應。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，發出奇怪的聲音。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2064", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到學姊害羞的表情，我就更放不開她了。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0402", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小、小熊喵！？那種眼神……呃……那個……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2065", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對、對了，吃飯！餵牠吃飯吧！」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，來吃飯吧！」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "mu2066", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一看到那種滿心期待的表情……我就無法繼續抱下去了。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "pn0403", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在熊喵面前，我們就是會莫名地害羞呢……", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
